            "review_text": "NorthStar42266391996\n1 contribution\n0\nWine.\nApr 2026 • Friends\nYour staff served very carefully, especially you Thalu and your Chi, your Mai Linh, your Hi Hi,\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 5, 2026\nSheraton Hanoi West\nDear Valued Guest, \n\nWe sincerely appreciate your thoughtful feedback and the five-star rating for Sheraton Hanoi West. It brings us great joy to know that you enjoyed our service. Your kind words about Ms. Chi, Ms. Thao, Ms. Linh, and Mr. Hieu mean a great deal to us, and we will be sure to share your compliments with them and the team. \nYour recognition is a wonderful encouragement for our team as we strive to create memorable experiences for every guest. \n\nWe look forward to welcoming you again soon and sharing more delightful moments with you.\n\nWarm regards, \nSheraton Hanoi West\nRead more\nWritten April 16, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
