            "review_text": "Michael L\nTaiwan5 contributions\n0\nGreat view, Great service\nMar 2025 • Solo\nThe chill music and relaxing atmosphere make it a perfect place to enjoy a cocktail while admiring the city from above. The service here is truly impressive, with attentive and professional staff. In particular, Dustin was very enthusiastic and knowledgeable about drinks. He made me an Espresso Martini and introduced me to the signature drinks that his team is preparing to launch. I was really excited because everything they aim to bring is the authentic taste of Vietnam. I will definitely come back to try those drinks\nRead more\nWritten March 11, 2025\nSheraton Hanoi West\nDear M2134KYmichaell,\n\nThank you for your wonderful review! We’re delighted that you enjoyed the breathtaking views, relaxing atmosphere, and expertly crafted cocktails. It’s fantastic to hear that Dustin’s enthusiasm and knowledge enhanced your experience—your kind words will surely make his day!\n\nWe’re especially excited that you appreciated our commitment to showcasing the authentic flavors of Vietnam. We look forward to welcoming you back soon so you can try our upcoming signature drinks!\n\nBest regards,\nSheraton Hanoi West\nRead more\nWritten March 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
