            "review_text": "TaipeiBeetle\nTaipei16 contributions\n0\nRelax in west Hanoi\nMar 2025 • Solo\nCocktail time with nice view and relaxing atmosphere. Suitable for sitting alone or having drinks with friends. Recommended.\nWritten March 10, 2025\nSheraton Hanoi West\nDear TaipeiBeetle,\n\nThank you for your kind review. We’re delighted to hear that you enjoyed the relaxing atmosphere and scenic views while unwinding with cocktails. Whether for a quiet moment alone or drinks with friends, we’re glad you found it to be a great experience.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recommendation and look forward to welcoming you back soon!\n\nBest regards,\nSheraton Hanoi West\nRead more\nWritten March 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
