            "review_text": "Departure54898062193\n2 contributions\n0\nBest skybar ever\nJan 2025 • Friends\nGreat view, delicious drinks, and friendly staff—especially Dustin, who was very enthusiastic and helpful. Both my friend and I were impressed by the service here. If I have the chance, I will choose the skybar at Sheraton Hanoi West to host a party.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 6, 2025\nSheraton Hanoi West\nDear Departure54898062193,\n\nThank you for your fantastic review and for sharing your experience at our Sky Bar. We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the stunning views, delicious drinks, and exceptional service from our team.\n\nA special thank you for recognizing Dustin—we will be sure to pass along your kind words, as they will surely serve as a great motivation for him and the entire team. Creating memorable experiences for our guests is our top priority, and we are thrilled that you and your friend were impressed by our hospitality.\n\nWe would be honored to host your future party at our Skybar. Please feel free to reach out whenever you are ready to plan your event—we would love to make it a truly special occasion.\n\nLooking forward to welcoming you back soon!\n\nBest regards,\nSheraton Hanoi West\nRead more\nWritten March 10, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
