            "review_text": "Robbert\nSingapore, Singapore7 contributions\n0\nIMPRESSIVE !!!!\nFeb 2025 • Solo\nThe service quality at Sky Bar is truly impressive. Especially under the supervision of Dustin, who made me a perfect Old Fashioned and showed me some new mixology ideas that his team has been working on. He also consistently demonstrates professionalism, dedication, and attention to detail, making me feel specially cared for. By the way, I will definitely come back here, not only for the service but also for the amazing view.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 2, 2025\nSheraton Hanoi West\nDear Rob311062,\n\nThank you for your fantastic review! We are delighted to hear that you had such an impressive experience at Sky Bar. It’s wonderful to know that Dustin’s expertise, professionalism, and attention to detail made your visit truly special.\n\nWe’re also pleased that you enjoyed the craft of our mixology team and the stunning views that make Sky Bar a unique destination. Your kind words will certainly be shared with Dustin and the team, as they take great pride in delivering exceptional service.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon for another outstanding experience—whether for the cocktails, the ambiance, or simply the breathtaking view.\n\nBest regards,\nSheraton Hanoi West\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
